ain infections. In fact, it helps on targeting <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">COX-2, the key mediator involved in\r\ninflammatory pathways for body. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Be brave to up your intake game !! <o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Did we say that Thyme Extract is perfect\r\nfor massage ? It is very comforting!<o:p></o:p></span></p>', '/storage/photos/1/Herbs/Herbal Extracts/Thyme Extract.jpg', 20, 'new', 'active', 360.00, 0.00, 1, 19, 22, 7, '2022-08-13 04:29:58', '2022-08-13 04:41:29'),
