(41, 'Asphaltum', 'Asphalt', 'asphaltum', '<p><b><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Calibri, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">Asphalt</span></b><br></p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">It may act\r\nas an energy booster<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Counters\r\nbrain disorders<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Enhances\r\nhormonal secretions <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">It may help\r\nin fighting fatigue and tiredness<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Asphaltum\r\nprevents ageing signs<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">It aids with\r\nhigh altitude sickness<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Counters\r\nanemia<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Asphaltum\r\nhelps in improving heart conditions<o:p></o:p></span></p>', '<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Mid-day\r\nenergy crash, Anyone? Once in a whole day, a time comes where ones literally\r\ncrash, need a nap, a sugary snack or caffeine to get them going.</span><span lang=\"EN-GB\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Can\r\nyou relate?</span><span lang=\"EN-GB\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"color: rgb(14, 49, 24); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Mother earth has blessed mankind in so many ways, gifted us\r\nmagical ingredients that do a wealth of good to our health and wellness.\r\nAmongst them, a valued product that has proven its goodness, time and again, is\r\nAsphaltum [Shilajit].</span><span lang=\"EN-GB\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"color: rgb(14, 49, 24); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">A wonder ingredient offering a host of health benefits, also\r\nknown as mineral pitch, usually grows in the mountainous regions. In India, it\r\nis the Himalayan mountain ranges that are a pristine source of this product and\r\nthat is exactly where&nbsp;Himalayan shilajit extract&nbsp;is procured\r\nfrom.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-GB\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"color: rgb(14, 49, 24); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Well, the name itself says it all!</span><span lang=\"EN-GB\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Calibri, &quot;sans-serif&quot;; color: rgb(14, 49, 24); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Asphaltum, may help in enhancing stamina &amp;\r\nvigour. It aids in reducing stress and anxiety levels where as carrying on the\r\nblessing, it improves brain health and can act as an anti-aging remedy. It may\r\nmark as an energiser, promoting holistic wellness at diverse grounds.</span><br></p>', '/storage/photos/1/Herbs/Herbal Extracts/Asphaltum.jpg', 20, 'default', 'active', 1500.00, 0.00, 1, 19, 22, 7, '2022-08-13 05:07:25', '2022-08-13 05:07:25'),
