&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">It may help in loosing extra\r\nweights<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Saffron oil counters hair loss<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Enhances mental health<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">It may help in fighting diabetes&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">We have a thing for body oils and have used\r\nquite a number of them. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Lets get a nick of saffron oil, where ones\r\nnever knew it could do wonders to skin until the herb room\'s <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">100% natural Saffron Oil.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">The Herbs Room\'s, Saffron Oil, is\r\nformulated by infusing 100 % natural Saffron strands in a blend of <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">natural oils. Saffron is loaded with\r\nantioxidants and has antibacterial properties that help fade blemishes <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">and acne, and also reduces signs of ageing.\r\n<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">By infusing Saffron in a blend of Argan,\r\nJojoba we may create a body oil that combats sun damage and <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">brightens your skin, while moisturizing it.\r\n<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">The active components in saffron have many\r\ntherapeutic properties. Saffron oil is antiseptic, <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">antidepressant, anti-oxidant, digestive and\r\nanti-convulsant. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Suitable for all skin types, Saffron Body\r\nOil is light and non-sticky and easily absorbed by skin. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Simply massage a few drops onto moist skin,\r\nafter a shower or a bath for soft, supple glowing skin.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Feel the love with the reds.<o:p></o:p></span></p>', '/storage/photos/1/Oils & Aromatherapy/Natural Herbal Oil/Saffron Oil.jpg', 20, 'new', 'active', 300.00, 0.00, 1, 27, 29, 7, '2022-08-13 05:13:21', '2022-08-13 05:13:21'),
(43, 'Resin', 'Rosen', 'resin', '<p><b><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Calibri, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">Rosen</span></b><br></p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">They may help in reducing\r\nArthritis<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Improves gut funtions<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Helps in treating bronchitis\r\nand asthma<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Resins may help in maintaining\r\noral health<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">They may counter cancer\r\nregulations<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Resins aids in fighting stress\r\nand anxiety<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Improves immunity levels<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">They may help in balancing\r\nhormonal levels<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\"><b><span lang=\"EN-GB\">As they are used in\r\ndying industry<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Resins help in creping control<b><o:p></o:p></b></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Improves wet strengths<b><o:p></o:p></b></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Reduces chemical costs <b><o:p></o:p></b></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Improves retention and counters\r\ndamages<b><o:p></o:p></b></span></p>', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Leaves, barks and flowers might all be\r\nfamiliar to you, but what about resins? Resins are the plant <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">material from which essential oils come\r\nfrom. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">A, sticky sap that exudes when a tree is\r\ncut or injured. These resins were prized gifts in biblical times and <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">used to make incense and oil infusions. In\r\nfact, Myrrh was an ingredient in holy anointing oil.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Even today, the resins from which popular\r\nessential oils are obtained, are used to better lives. Resins, <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">showed to have antitumoral, antioxidant and\r\nanti-inflammatory properties, as well as improve cognitive <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">function. They have also been pinned to\r\nhave similar properties. Resins are often grinded down and <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">used in preparations, serums and ointments.\r\nThey can also be burned and diffused as incense.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Much like their essential oil counterparts,\r\nresins are highly beneficial aromatics that have been used to <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">benefit people throughout history. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Have you used resins before? Let us know in\r\nthe comments section below!<o:p></o:p></span></p>', '/storage/photos/1/Gums/Gum Resins/Resin.jpg', 20, 'default', 'active', 60.00, 0.00, 1, 24, 25, 7, '2022-08-13 05:19:20', '2022-08-13 05:19:20'),
(44, 'Sal Tree', 'Shorea Robusta Gaertn', 'sal-tree', '<p>Sal Tree<br></p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Sal tree is used as a wound\r\nhealer<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">It may help in treating stomach\r\nproblems<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Counters inflammations<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">May clear respiratory tract<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">It can be used as an energy booster<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Sal tree spines for skin relief<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">It can help in burn injuries <o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">May help in treating cold and\r\nfever<o:p></o:p></span></p>', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Just make your steps stair for the gem.\r\nThis is a guest resin.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Sal tree Resin, the appearance is\r\nunworldly, it looks like moon rock! <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">The scent is mysterious, intriguing and\r\nspicy with hints of brown sugar. This is a fairly thick resin, leading <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">to make fat bubbles! Very fibrous when it\r\ncomes to cooling it down<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">The extracted has carminative, stomachic,\r\nand astringent properties. It may help in giving relief in skin <o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">disorders, pain in nerves, burn injury,\r\nfever, enlargement of the spleen, abnormal discharge from the body\r\n(menorrhagia, leucorrhoea), diarrhea, and bleeding piles.<o:p></o:p></span></p>', '/storage/photos/1/Gums/Gum Resins/Shorea Robusta Gaertn.jpg', 20, 'new', 'active', 30.00, 0.00, 1, 24, 25, 7, '2022-08-13 05:24:40', '2022-08-13 05:24:40');
INSERT INTO `products` (`id`, `title`, `scientific`, `slug`, `summary`, `Other`, `Other1`, `Other2`, `Other3`, `Other4`, `Other5`, `Other6`, `benafit`, `description`, `photo`, `stock`, `condition`, `status`, `price`, `discount`, `is_featured`, `cat_id`, `child_cat_id`, `brand_id`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(45, 'Gum Karaya', 'Astragallus Gummifier', 'gum-karaya', '<p>Gum Karaya<br></p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">It can be used as a laxative<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">It is adhesive for dental\r\nimplants<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Gum karaya may help in treating\r\nsore throats<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">It helps in maintaing blood\r\nsugars<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">May act beneficial for people\r\ncountering high cholesterol<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Gum karaya may help in wound\r\nhealing and bed sores<o:p></o:p></span></p>', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Are you looking for a safe, natural and healthy\r\ngum ingredient to emulsify your beverage or treat your health condition?<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&nbsp;If yes,\r\nyou will be pleased to learn about the benefits of gum for confectionery\r\ncoating product has to offer. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Unlike other starches or chemically modified\r\ningredients, this gem makes the healthiest emulsification agent for beverages,\r\ndairy products and cereal bars. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">The herb room with Karaya gum, &nbsp;uses a chemical-free process to produce a\r\nhealthy product with impressive microbial properties.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">The microbial properties of karaya gum make it\r\na perfect laxative agent. While the gum doesn’t get digested or absorbed in\r\nyour body. The gum’s bonding properties make it a perfect adhesive for dental\r\nimplants since it is placed at the base of salicylic patches. karaya gum make\r\nit ideal for treating sore throats. Emulsifier for medical jellies and pastes</span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#404040\"><br>\r\n<span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Its binding properties make it perfect for\r\nmaking medical jellies and pastes.<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>', '/storage/photos/1/Gums/Gum Resins/Gum Karaya.jpg', 20, 'new', 'active', 80.00, 0.00, 1, 24, 25, 7, '2022-08-13 05:29:40', '2022-08-13 05:29:40'),
(46, 'Gum Arabic', 'Acacia Tree', 'gum-arabic', '<p><b><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Calibri, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">Gum Arabic</span></b><br></p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><ul style=\"margin-top:0cm\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#0A0A0A;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n     list 36.0pt;background:#FEFEFE\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Provides a source of&nbsp;prebiotics and soluble fiber <o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#0A0A0A;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n     list 36.0pt;background:#FEFEFE\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Feeds healthy bacteria in the gut.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#0A0A0A;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n     list 36.0pt;background:#FEFEFE\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">May help to enhance fullness and satiety.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#0A0A0A;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n     list 36.0pt;background:#FEFEFE\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Helps with weight loss and potentially prevention of\r\n     obesity.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#0A0A0A;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n     list 36.0pt;background:#FEFEFE\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">May treat&nbsp;constipation.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#0A0A0A;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n     list 36.0pt;background:#FEFEFE\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Gum arabic regulates cholesterol levels.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#0A0A0A;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n     list 36.0pt;background:#FEFEFE\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Counters insulin resistance, including in patients with\r\n     type 2 diabetes.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#0A0A0A;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n     list 36.0pt;background:#FEFEFE\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">May reduce dental plaque on the gums and teeth, plus\r\n     fighting gingivitis.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#0A0A0A;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n     list 36.0pt;background:#FEFEFE\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Having anti-carcinogenic, anti-inflammatory and\r\n     antioxidant effects, thanks to its tannins, flavonoids and resins.&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:#0A0A0A;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:\r\n     list 36.0pt;background:#FEFEFE\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">It may help in reducing skin&nbsp;inflammation&nbsp;and\r\n     redness.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"color: rgb(12, 12, 12); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Many people\r\nstruggle to get enough fiber in their diet. However, eating more fiber has\r\nbenefits that extend beyond digestive health. It can help fight obesity and\r\ndiabetes, and boost immunity.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Food manufacturers use acacia fiber to thicken\r\nbeverages and enhance flavor and texture </span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">breakfast cereals</span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">.\r\nBecause it’s rich in soluble fiber, acacia fiber is also added to food as a\r\nsource of dietary fiber.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Available in powdered form, the fiber\r\nsupplement has a neutral taste and mixes well with drinks, </span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">smoothies</span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">,\r\nand soups.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Gum arabic benefits heart health by lowering\r\ncholesterol. More specifically, soluble fiber lowers cholesterol by reducing\r\nabsorption of cholesterol in the gut and increasing excretion of bile. Gum\r\nArabic supplementation may improve diabetes management by preventing weight\r\ngain, lowering blood pressure, and modifying the effects body fat has on\r\ninsulin resistance.<o:p></o:p></span></p>', '/storage/photos/1/Gums/Gum Resins/Gum Arabic.jpg', 20, 'new', 'active', 100.00, 0.00, 1, 24, 25, 7, '2022-08-13 05:34:41', '2022-08-13 05:34:41'),
(47, 'Salai Tree', 'Salai Tree', 'salai-tree', '<p><b><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Calibri, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">Commiphora Mukul,&nbsp;</span></b><font face=\"Calibri, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\"><b>Salai Tree</b></span></font><br></p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">It may help in countering joint\r\npains<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Majorly helps with Arthritis<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Salai tree resins may help in\r\nreducing inflammations<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">It improves kidney health<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Acts to be great for asthma\r\npatients<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">It is used as incense because\r\nof its unique fragrance<o:p></o:p></span></p>', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#231F20\">Count in steps for a Strong reach !\r\nThe naturally extracted resin counts to be a bliss for the herb family. Dive in\r\ndeep for the desirable extractions.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#231F20\">The resin of Salai tree has been used\r\nfor centuries both culturally and medicinally, stemming from North Africa, West\r\nAsia, and the dry mountainous regions of South Asia. Historically, salai tree\r\nhas been used to support health in the presence of certain chronic inflammatory\r\ndiseases. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#231F20\">The study and research grounds\r\nsuggests that it shows promise in ailments such as bronchial asthma, bursitis,\r\nrheumatoid arthritis, Crohn’s disease, and other inflammatory conditions.\r\nHowever, Salai trees currently known best for its support with osteoarthritis.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#231F20\">Overactive inflammation that goes\r\nunchecked in the body is linked to many health problems of our time. Salai tree\r\nextract is showing a lot of promise in many of these inflammatory conditions.<o:p></o:p></span></p>', '/storage/photos/1/Gums/Gum Resins/Salai Tree.jpg', 20, 'new', 'active', 75.00, 0.00, 1, 24, 25, 7, '2022-08-13 05:42:25', '2022-08-13 05:42:25'),
(48, 'Himalayan Salt Lamp Pyramid', 'Himalayan Salt Lamp Pyramid', 'himalayan-salt-lamp-pyramid', '<p><b><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Calibri, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">Himalayan Salt Lamp Pyramid</span></b><br></p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">It neutralizes electromagnetic\r\nradiations<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Helps in reducing fatigue and\r\ntiredness<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">It may boost immunity levels<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Aids people with insomnia<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Can act as an activity booster<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">It helps in preventing\r\nallergies<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Counters to control asthma<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Improves mindfulness<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-GB;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">Salt\r\nlamp enhances work productivity</span><br></p>', '<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin-bottom: 11.25pt; line-height: 19.2pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"color:#333333\">Ever\r\nwonder, no matter how&nbsp;exhausted you are, you still struggle to get sleep? <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-bottom: 11.25pt; line-height: 19.2pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"color:#333333\">Before&nbsp;taking&nbsp;that\r\nsleeping pill, think about what made you feel tired throughout the day.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin-bottom: 11.25pt; line-height: 19.2pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"color:#333333\">But,\r\nwhat if there\'s a calming&nbsp;energy that can help you relieve stress and\r\nanxiety before bed?&nbsp;Here\'s when the Himalayan Salt Lamp comes in.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Himalayan\r\nSalt Lamps are aesthetically beautiful &nbsp;that&nbsp;provide\r\na sense of ease&nbsp;and&nbsp;a warm glow. Blocks of pure Himalayan salt from\r\nancient oceans known as the \"Vitamins of the Air\" have\r\nmany&nbsp;health benefits&nbsp;and&nbsp;healing properties.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Raise\r\nhands for the pyramid shaped Himalayan salt lamp for a worth of benefits and\r\nmoment sprouting days and nights.<o:p></o:p></span></p>', '/storage/photos/1/Other/Herbal Gift Set/Himalayan Salt Lamp Pyramid.jpg', 20, 'default', 'active', 90.00, 0.00, 1, 54, 55, 7, '2022-08-13 07:00:40', '2022-08-13 07:00:40'),
(49, 'Himalayan Salt Lamp Mushroom', 'Himalayan Salt Lamp Mushroom', 'himalayan-salt-lamp-mushroom', '<p><b><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Calibri, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">Himalayan Salt Lamp Mushroom</span></b><br></p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Arial Black&quot;;\">﻿</span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 1rem; font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 1rem;\">They may help people having sleep issues</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: -18pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Provides energy towards effective plays<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: -18pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Salt lamp may counter allergies<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 1rem;\">·</span><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;;\">﻿</span></p>', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#231F20\">Living in the digital age, we can\'t\r\nimagine our lives without tech appliances such as computers, tablets,\r\ntelevisions, air conditioners, geysers, cell phones, etc. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#231F20\">Unfortunately, these devices may be\r\nharmful in different variations.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">One of the most compelling benefits of\r\nHimalayan Salt lamps&nbsp;is their&nbsp;ability to purify the air&nbsp;by\r\nremoving dust, cigarette smoke, pollen, pet dander, and other contaminants in\r\nthe atmosphere. This is enough to keep one in your home,&nbsp;especially if you\r\nsmoke or have pets.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Even asthma patients have claimed that having\r\nSalt lamps&nbsp;around aids breathing.&nbsp;As a result, Himalayan salt\r\ninhalers&nbsp;are recommended for patients suffering from asthma, bronchitis\r\nand respiratory diseases.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>', '/storage/photos/1/Other/Herbal Gift Set/Himalayan Salt Lamp Mushroom.jpg', 20, 'new', 'active', 90.00, 0.00, 1, 54, 55, 7, '2022-08-13 07:10:02', '2022-08-13 07:10:02'),
