areast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#231F20\">Stair up for these thin brick salt\r\nlamps for a desirable experience.<o:p></o:p></span></p>', '/storage/photos/1/Other/Herbal Gift Set/Himalayan Salt Lamp Thin Bricks.jpg', 20, 'default', 'active', 25.00, 0.00, 1, 54, 55, 7, '2022-08-13 07:41:47', '2022-08-13 07:41:47'),
