;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;;\">●<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">It may\r\ncounter acne<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:72.0pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\nborder:none;mso-padding-alt:31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt;mso-border-shadow:yes\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;;\">●<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Sandalwood\r\npowder helps in tuning skin even<o:p></o:p></span></p>', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Sandalwood is a much-loved fragrance across\r\nthe world, often evoking soft breezes, restful spaces, and a sense of peace and\r\ncalm. It’s commonly used in aromatherapy and meditation practice around the\r\nworld.<o:p></o:p></span></p>', '/storage/photos/1/Herbs/Herbal Powder/Sandalwood Powder.jpg', 20, 'new', 'active', 1200.00, 0.00, 1, 19, 21, 7, '2022-08-13 08:36:16', '2022-08-13 08:36:16'),
(64, 'Kokum Butter', 'Kokum Butter', 'kokum-butter', '<p><b><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Calibri, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">Kokum Butter</span></b><br></p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;\r\nmargin-left:36.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\nborder:none;mso-padding-alt:31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt;mso-border-shadow:yes\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;;\">●<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">It may help\r\nin skin cell generation<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;\r\nmargin-left:36.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\nborder:none;mso-padding-alt:31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt;mso-border-shadow:yes\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;;\">●<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">It may act\r\nas an alternative for sensitive skin<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;\r\nmargin-left:36.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\nborder:none;mso-padding-alt:31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt;mso-border-shadow:yes\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;;\">●<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;Kokum butter may help in skin moisturizing<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;\r\nmargin-left:36.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\nborder:none;mso-padding-alt:31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt;mso-border-shadow:yes\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;;\">●<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Rich in\r\nvitamins, helps in fighting free radicals<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;\r\nmargin-left:36.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\nborder:none;mso-padding-alt:31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt;mso-border-shadow:yes\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;\r\nmargin-left:36.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\nborder:none;mso-padding-alt:31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt;mso-border-shadow:yes\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;;\">●<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">It may\r\ncounter visible signs of ageing<o:p></o:p></span></p>', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">KOKUM BUTTER - IS IT\r\nBETTER?<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">This lovely looking\r\ncollection of plant material is the fruit, seeds, pulp and rinds of the\r\ngarcenia indica plant. It\'s edible and has a wide range of culinary uses (for\r\nexample, a lovely red sherbet ice cream), but despite tempting yumminess, we\'re\r\nnot going to talk about food today.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Instead, we\'re going to\r\nhave a look at what comes from the seeds of this colourful and exotic plant,\r\nbecause we\'re going to be getting a little butter happy around here in the\r\ncoming weeks.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Mangoes cousin, <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Kokum butter&nbsp; is a member of the mango family. It grows in\r\nIndia, Africa, and Asia, and if it had a choice, would definitely choose\r\nevergreen forests as its ideal place to thrive. It will, however, do quite well\r\nin some areas with low rainfall.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Cultivating kokum is\r\nabout as environmentally friendly as it can be. This sturdy plant does not\r\nrequire any spraying of pesticides or fertilisers in order to yield well.<o:p></o:p></span></p>', '/storage/photos/1/Herbal Cosmetic/Body Butters/Kokum Butter.jpg', 20, 'new', 'active', 300.00, 0.00, 1, 43, 45, 7, '2022-08-13 08:40:06', '2022-08-13 08:40:06');
INSERT INTO `products` (`id`, `title`, `scientific`, `slug`, `summary`, `Other`, `Other1`, `Other2`, `Other3`, `Other4`, `Other5`, `Other6`, `benafit`, `description`, `photo`, `stock`, `condition`, `status`, `price`, `discount`, `is_featured`, `cat_id`, `child_cat_id`, `brand_id`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(65, 'Mango Butter', 'Mango Butter', 'mango-butter', '<p><b><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Calibri, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">Mango Butter</span></b><br></p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;\r\nmargin-left:36.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\nborder:none;mso-padding-alt:31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt;mso-border-shadow:yes\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;;\">●<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">It may\r\nprotect from UV rays<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;\r\nmargin-left:36.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\nborder:none;mso-padding-alt:31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt;mso-border-shadow:yes\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;;\">●<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Mango\r\nbutter is skin friendly<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;\r\nmargin-left:36.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\nborder:none;mso-padding-alt:31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt;mso-border-shadow:yes\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;;\">●<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">It may help\r\nin fighting infections and bacteria<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;\r\nmargin-left:36.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\nborder:none;mso-padding-alt:31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt;mso-border-shadow:yes\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;;\">●<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Mango\r\nbutter spines for hair shine<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;\r\nmargin-left:36.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\nborder:none;mso-padding-alt:31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt;mso-border-shadow:yes\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;;\">●<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">It may act\r\nas a moisturizer<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\nborder:none;mso-padding-alt:31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt;mso-border-shadow:yes\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;;\">●<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Helps in\r\ncountering acne and wrinkles<o:p></o:p></span></p>', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Hearing the name of this fruit, the one\r\nthing that pops in our head instantly is how it can be used to make some of my\r\nfavorite smoothies and shakes.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;But\r\nyes, this luscious tropical ingredient with its distinctive flavor can be used\r\nin several ways to enhance your skin and keep it soft and well cared for. Mango\r\nbody butter has been gradually making a name for itself in the beauty industry\r\nand garnering appreciation.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;If\r\nyou aren’t in the loop and need more information regarding this ingredient,\r\nthen keep on scrolling to know all about it.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Mango Butter can do wonders for skin\r\nproblems. Adding a little to your facial moisturizer or serum can help problem skin\r\nlook and feel better quickly. Mango butter also works excellently to bring\r\nsoftness to curly hair and dry hair. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">I have rather coarse hair that has a little\r\nwave and a lot of frizz and I love to use a little mango butter, virgin coconut\r\noil,&nbsp; and fresh banana for a fun\r\nsummertime hair mask. It leaves your hair soft and shiny and seems to reduce\r\nthe frizziness. Mango butter can also be used to thicken oils for a luxurious\r\nfacial serum.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>', '/storage/photos/1/Herbal Cosmetic/Body Butters/Mango Butter.jpg', 20, 'new', 'active', 300.00, 0.00, 1, 43, 45, 7, '2022-08-13 08:47:46', '2022-08-13 08:47:46'),
(66, 'French Green Clay', 'French Green Clay', 'french-green-clay', '<p>French Green Clay<br></p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;\r\nmargin-left:36.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\nborder:none;mso-padding-alt:31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt;mso-border-shadow:yes\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;;\">●<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Dead skin\r\ncells are gently whisked away by the green clay<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;\r\nmargin-left:36.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\nborder:none;mso-padding-alt:31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt;mso-border-shadow:yes\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;;\">●<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">French\r\ngreen clay is particularly effective at drawing out impurities<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;\r\nmargin-left:36.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\nborder:none;mso-padding-alt:31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt;mso-border-shadow:yes\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;;\">●<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">By removing\r\nimpurities and dead skin cells that can clog pores and contribute towards\r\nblemishes<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;\r\nmargin-left:36.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\nborder:none;mso-padding-alt:31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt;mso-border-shadow:yes\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;;\">●<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">It may help\r\nin toning and firming the skin<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\r\nborder:none;mso-padding-alt:31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt 31.0pt;mso-border-shadow:yes\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;;\">●<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">It soothes\r\ncuts, scraps and minor burns<o:p></o:p></span></p>', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Heard of French Green Clay?<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Over the years, there have been tons of\r\nso-called holy grails in the world of beauty and skincare. There’s green tea,\r\naloe vera, olive oil, rosehip oil, rosemary extract, apple cider vinegar, shea\r\nbutter, tea tree oil, and coconut to name a few.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;Beauty gurus and skincare aficionados might\r\nthink they’ve seen it all, but wait until they encounter French green clay.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Also called Sea Clay or Illite Clay, this\r\nskin-soothing wonder product promises a multitude of benefits for normal, oily,\r\nand combination skin types.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;It\r\nis abundant in western France, particularly in a small town called Montmorillon\r\nin the Poitou-Charentes region. French green clay is mined from natural\r\nresources, and it is a fusion of algae, iron oxides, and other naturally\r\ndecomposing matter like chlorophyll.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;Aside from these ingredients, several other\r\nmineral deposits are typically found in the skin-pampering green clay.<o:p></o:p></span></p>', '/storage/photos/1/Herbal Cosmetic/Herbal Clay/French Green Clay.jpg', 20, 'default', 'active', 200.00, 0.00, 0, 43, 44, 7, '2022-08-13 09:03:24', '2022-08-13 09:03:24'),
(67, 'French Pink Clay', 'French Pink Clay', 'french-pink-clay', '<p><b><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Calibri, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">French Pink Clay</span></b><br></p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">We came across a clay that we fell in love\r\nwith. It was the perfect colour pink and when we ran our hands through it, it\r\nwas as if I was running our hands through silk. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">The powder was weightless and when you\r\ntried to pinch it, it was almost as if it would dissolve right in your hand. We\r\nthought to our self, this is by far the softest, smoothest clay, we have ever\r\nfelt. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">We had tried other pink clays, but none\r\ncame close to this one. First, it was so pink, which we found out later, is\r\nvery rare. The texture alone made us want to try it.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Pink clay is actually suitable for any skin\r\ntype, but people with sensitive skin especially praise this type of clay for\r\nbeing so gentle and delicate with already problematic and troubled skin.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">What makes this type of clay so gentle and\r\nsuitable for dry, dehydrated and sensitive skin?&nbsp; Unlike other clays, pink clay does not strip\r\noff skin natural oil barrier<b><o:p></o:p></b></span></p>', '/storage/photos/1/Herbal Cosmetic/Herbal Clay/French Pink Clay.jpg', 20, 'new', 'active', 200.00, 0.00, 1, 43, 44, 7, '2022-08-13 09:09:58', '2022-08-13 09:09:58'),
(68, 'French Red Clay', 'French Red Clay', 'french-red-clay', '<p><b><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Calibri, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">French Red Clay</span></b><br></p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">It has the\r\nability to extract out impurities<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">It may help\r\nin countering inflammations<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">French Red\r\nClay has antiseptic properties<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">It may help\r\nto get rid of dandruff<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Spines up\r\nfor blood circulation in body<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">French Red\r\nClay helps in skin repairs<o:p></o:p></span></p>', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Known since the dawn of time, red clay is\r\nthe beauty ally of women who like to take care of their bodies and hair, with\r\n100% natural products. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Zoom!<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">The first woman to be completely seduced by\r\nred clay is Cleopatra. The Egyptian queen used it daily for her care and balms.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Since then, this miracle red powder has\r\nmade a prominent place in contemporary society, as its benefits for skin and\r\nhair are numerous.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">It is mainly recommended for sensitive, dry\r\nand tired skin. The red clay will soothe the skin and reduce redness! A great\r\nway to say bye-bye to its imperfections, in a natural way!<o:p></o:p></span></p>', '/storage/photos/1/Herbal Cosmetic/Herbal Clay/French Red Clay.jpg', 20, 'default', 'active', 200.00, 0.00, 1, 43, 44, 7, '2022-08-13 09:14:16', '2022-08-13 09:14:16'),
(69, 'Rhassoul Clay', 'Rhassoul Clay', 'rhassoul-clay', '<p><b><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Calibri, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">Rhassoul Clay</span></b><br></p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin-left:72.0pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;It is\r\nnourishing and softens hair naturally.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:72.0pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;It adds\r\nto the curl definition as well.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:72.0pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;Rhassoul\r\nclay may acts as a gentle exfoliator and eliminates dead skin cells from your\r\nscalp without being harsh.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:72.0pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;It may help\r\nin balancing the sebum production that causes dandruff.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:72.0pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">This\r\nnatural shampoo may remove oil and dirt from your scalp and adds volume to flat\r\nhair.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:72.0pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">It gently\r\nunclogs pores and attracts dead skin and toxins from your skin, leaving it\r\nsupple and nourished.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:72.0pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Rhassoul\r\nclay may deeply clean the skin, removing blackheads, and tightening the pores.</span></p>', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Rhassoul clay is\r\nextremely versatile. It is perfect for both oily and dry skin. Psoriasis and\r\neczema can irritate your skin. These conditions cause extreme dryness that can\r\ncrack open your skin and make it bleed. The Moroccan clay has a soothing effect\r\nthat helps with inflamed skin.</span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Description<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Clays have landed a starring role in beauty\r\nroutines for thousands of years—not only do they banish blackheads and lift oil\r\nand gunk from pores, but they also come loaded with skin-healthy minerals.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;But\r\ndepending on where it\'s sourced, the ancient soil may offer slightly skewed\r\nbenefits: The region, particle size, and composition matter when choosing your\r\nmineral mud.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Specifically, many sing the praises of the\r\nclay\'s exfoliating, clarifying properties: \"It can help cleanse the skin\r\nby removing excess oil and dead skin cells as well as leave skin softer and smooth<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">And as the clay lifts oil and grime, many\r\nclaim it also infuses the skin with its healthy minerals. In that case, Rhassoul\r\nclay can condition and strengthen the skin with its potassium (which has\r\nantimicrobial properties), calcium, and magnesium content (both shown to help\r\nsupport skin barrier repair).<o:p></o:p></span></p>', '/storage/photos/1/Herbal Cosmetic/Herbal Clay/Rhassoul Clay.jpg', 20, 'default', 'active', 200.00, 0.00, 1, 43, 44, 7, '2022-08-13 09:29:28', '2022-08-13 09:29:28'),
(70, 'Zeolite Clay', 'Zeolite Clay', 'zeolite-clay', '<p><b><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Calibri, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">Zeolite Clay</span></b><br></p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">It is\r\nmarked as a source of antioxidants<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Spines up\r\nin balancing pH levels<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Zeolite\r\nclay may help in fighting body toxins<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">It improves\r\nhealthy digestion<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">It may act\r\nas an immunity booster<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Zeolite\r\nclay boosts brain activities<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">It may help\r\nin strengthening cardiovascular health<o:p></o:p></span></p>', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">The Ultimate Detoxifier<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Individuals everywhere, every day are\r\nwaking up from a long slumber and are taking action towards a healthier,\r\ncleaner, purer lifestyle. Detoxification programs and retreats are at an\r\nall-time high. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Clay eating and clay bathing have been\r\ndetermined to be one of the great solutions to help free ourselves from\r\nenvironmental and food toxins.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Zeolite is one of nature’s few negatively\r\ncharged minerals, which means it’s able to bind and remove toxins from your\r\nskin. This powerful mineral works to draw and remove impurities and protect\r\nyour skin from free radicals.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Due to the detoxifying power of this\r\nmineral, it is important that you are using a Zeolite that is of the highest\r\nquality and is not contaminated in any way.<o:p></o:p></span></p>', '/storage/photos/1/Herbal Cosmetic/Herbal Clay/Zeolite Clay.jpg', 20, 'new', 'active', 200.00, 0.00, 1, 43, 44, 7, '2022-08-13 09:33:33', '2022-08-13 09:33:33'),
(71, 'Glycerine', 'Glycerine', 'glycerine', '<p><b><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Calibri, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">Glycerine</span></b><br></p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">It may act\r\nas a skin cleanser<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Helps in\r\nlessening the pore size and toning the skin<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Glycerine\r\nmay help in minimizing water loss from the body<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">It may\r\ncounter acne and blackheads<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Safe for\r\nbaby sensitive skins<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">It may act\r\nas a sunscreen<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Glycerine\r\nspines for a glowing and healthier skin<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">It may help\r\nin getting rid of dry, chapped lips<o:p></o:p></span></p>', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Glycerine has been relegated to the sides\r\nof the stage for too long, but it’s about time this hero hydrator is promoted\r\nto the herb room in our skincare repertoires.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;With\r\nthe power to replenish moisture without clogging pores or causing irritation,\r\nthis lightweight active ingredient is well deserving of the spotlight.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">This organic compound, to give you a small\r\nchemistry lesson, is a mixture of sugar and alcohol. The liquid is thick,\r\nslightly sweet, has no colour and no smell.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;But\r\nit packs a punch when it comes to working magic on your skin. Many commercial\r\nbeauty products use glycerine in their composition. But you can use it by\r\nitself (along with some other products found at home) and create your own\r\narsenal of beauty treatment.<o:p></o:p></span></p>', '/storage/photos/1/Herbal Cosmetic/Cosmetic Ingredient/Glycerine.jpg', 20, 'new', 'active', 50.00, 0.00, 1, 43, 46, 7, '2022-08-13 09:38:19', '2022-08-13 09:38:19'),
(72, 'Fullers Earth Clay', 'Fullers Earth Clay', 'fullers-earth-clay', '<p><b><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Calibri, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">Fullers Earth Clay</span></b><br></p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">It may help\r\nin absorbing excess skin oils<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Fuller’s\r\nEarth Clay may counter acne and pimples<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Helps in\r\nreducing scars and marks<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Improves\r\nskin elasticity<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Spines for\r\nremoving dead skin<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">It may help\r\nin removing blackheads and whiteheads<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Counters\r\nskin irritation and tightens pores<o:p></o:p></span></p>', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Like with any beauty ingredients in your\r\nskincare routine, whether all-natural or otherwise, you should always know what\r\nyou\'re putting on your skin.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;Fuller’s\r\nearth; for many centuries now has been used as one of the most important staple\r\ningredients in the world of health and beauty. In India, we know of Fuller’s\r\nearth as multani mitti.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Fuller\'s earth is a mineral clay extracted\r\nfrom the earth used for a wide variety of things. A popular beauty ingredient,\r\nit is composed of minerals such as magnesium, aluminium, iron, and silica,\r\nwhich are all very absorbent<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">It helps give your skin that radiant,\r\nluminous glow. It\'s also found in other products like body lotion, shampoos and\r\nconditioners, soaps, concealers, powders, and more and can be used medically to\r\ntreat burns and wounds.<o:p></o:p></span></p>', '/storage/photos/1/Herbal Cosmetic/Herbal Clay/Fullers Earth Clay.jpg', 20, 'default', 'active', 200.00, 0.00, 1, 43, 44, 7, '2022-08-13 09:42:21', '2022-08-13 09:42:21'),
(73, 'Bentonite Clay', 'Bentonite Clay', 'bentonite-clay', '<p><b><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Calibri, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">Bentonite Clay</span></b><br></p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">It helps in\r\nremoving toxins from the body<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Counters\r\nskin acne<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">It may help\r\nin treating oily skin<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Bentonite\r\nclay aids in weight loss<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Helps in\r\nrelieving constipation<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">It may help\r\nin providing sun protection<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Bentonite\r\nclay help in removing lead and other heavy metals from the body<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Calibri, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">It may help in lowering cholesterol levels&nbsp;</span><br></p>', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">If we take a cue from nature, many animals\r\nwill instinctively turn to eating dirt and clay to help remove poisons from\r\ntheir systems or during times of illness or distress.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">More recently, bentonite clay have once\r\nagain gained popularity for internal and external detoxification, and with good\r\nreason.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Healing clays like bentonite have a high\r\nconcentration of minerals including silica, calcium, magnesium, sodium, iron,\r\nand potassium. It also absorbs and removes toxins, heavy metals, impurities,\r\nand chemicals.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Because of this, bentonite clay is a common\r\ningredient in detox and cleansing products. Common external uses include\r\npoultices, mud packs, detox baths, and skin care recipes.<o:p></o:p></span></p>', '/storage/photos/1/Herbal Cosmetic/Herbal Clay/Bentonite Clay.jpg', 20, 'default', 'active', 200.00, 0.00, 1, 43, 44, 7, '2022-08-13 09:46:34', '2022-08-13 09:46:34');
INSERT INTO `products` (`id`, `title`, `scientific`, `slug`, `summary`, `Other`, `Other1`, `Other2`, `Other3`, `Other4`, `Other5`, `Other6`, `benafit`, `description`, `photo`, `stock`, `condition`, `status`, `price`, `discount`, `is_featured`, `cat_id`, `child_cat_id`, `brand_id`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(74, 'Gum Copal', 'Gum Copal', 'gum-copal', '<p><b><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Calibri, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">Gum Copal</span></b><br></p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">It may help\r\nin winding down stress<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">A powerful\r\nincense for meditation<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">It may act\r\nas an energetic cleanser<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Gum Copal\r\ncan be used as a varnish or waterproofing material<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">It may help\r\nin countering inflammations<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Calibri, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">Spines up for a healthier and integral living by boosting brain\r\nactivities</span><br></p>', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Since people first came together to honour\r\nthe Gods and spirits of nature they used gums, resins and fragrant herbs to\r\nbring them closer to the divine beings and to give fragrant wings to their\r\nprayers. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Known for its ability to elicit mentally\r\nuplifting and calming effects, Copal is rich in triterpenes that have been\r\nshown to significantly reduce anxiety. Burning this resin is thought to\r\nactivate “ion” channels in the brain, helping to alleviate stress and anxiety.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">These calming effects of Copal also allow\r\nthe body to wind down and destress in readiness for sleep. It has long been\r\nused by the ancients to promote emotional balance and to calm down the nervous\r\nsystem.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Copal derives from various types of Bursera\r\ntrees that are native to the Americas and related to Frankincense and Myrrh.\r\nTrue Copal was and still is the most important incense of the Maya.&nbsp; Both types of Copal hold their place as\r\nsacred gums burnt for purification, protection against the evil eye and the demons\r\nof disease, healing, love and divination.<o:p></o:p></span></p>', '/storage/photos/1/Gums/Gum Resins/Gum Copal.jpg', 20, 'new', 'active', 180.00, 0.00, 1, 24, 25, 7, '2022-08-13 09:50:09', '2022-08-13 09:50:09'),
(75, 'Gum Frankincense', 'Gum Frankincense', 'gum-frankincense', '<p><b><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Calibri, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">Gum Frankincense&nbsp;</span></b><br></p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">It may help\r\nin reducing arthritis<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">The gum may\r\nhelp in improving gut function<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Improves\r\nrespiratory regulations<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Spines up\r\nfor maintaining oral health<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\">It may\r\nconstitute anti cancer properties<o:p></o:p></span></p>', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Every culture has their own sacred herbs\r\nthat are particular to its region, yet, precious incense herbs and gums have\r\nalso always been traded far beyond their country of origin. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">We offer a selection of these Sacred Herbs,\r\nGums and Resins for those who wish to experiment with their own incense blends<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Frankincense has a woody, spicy smell and\r\ncan be inhaled, absorbed through the skin, or taken as a supplement.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">We find resins fascinating, more so than\r\nany other plant material and we seem to have an affinity to frankincense. We\r\nthink this is probably something to do with my family often burning\r\nfrankincense resin in our homes.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">We also really like infusing resins, it\'s\r\nvery easy to do and you extract great results every time.<o:p></o:p></span></p>', '/storage/photos/1/Gums/Gum Resins/Gum Frankincense.jpg', 20, 'new', 'active', 80.00, 0.00, 1, 24, 25, 7, '2022-08-13 09:53:05', '2022-08-13 09:53:05');

